hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"168","Al-Hasan bin Muhammad, Abu Al-Khattab Ziyad bin Yahya, Ishaq bin Hatim bin Bayan Al-Madaini, and a group of others told us, They said: Yahya bin Sulaym told us, Ismail bin Kathir told me, on the authority of Asim bin Laqit bin Sabra, on the authority of his father, he said: I said: Oh Messenger of God, tell me about ablution. He said: “Perform ablution thoroughly, touch your fingers, and breathe deeply unless you are fasting.”"
